description: inputs / ui / layouts conventions
globs: src/components/**/*.{ts,tsx}
alwaysApply: false
---

# Components

**inputs:** label + `helperText`/`error`/`containerClassName`; `describedBy`/`fieldMessage` via if/else. Custom select/date = button trigger + button options (not native select unless asked). Permissions = `ToggleBadges` ≠ `MultiBadgesInput`.

**ui:** Button/IconButton/TextButton + `forwardRef` when focus matters. ConfirmDialog/Modal = `<dialog>`+`showModal()`; listeners in effect not JSX. Table = `columns`/`data`/`getRowId` + cell helpers; no click on `<tr>`.

**layouts:** DashboardHeader search = ⌘K trigger (`onSearchOpen`). Sidebar wordmark `/sidebar/neptune-wordmark.svg`; active `bg-blue-normal/18 text-blue-normal`. Export via local `index.ts`.
